---
import DocPage from './DocPage.astro';
import { useT, localizePath, type Locale } from '../../i18n/ui';
import { getDisputedNotes } from '../../lib/data-server';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../../lib/site';
interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const tr = useT(locale);
const notes = getDisputedNotes();
const zh = locale === 'zh-Hant';
---

<DocPage
  locale={locale}
  title={tr('page.boundaries.title')}
  lede={zh
    ? '邊界從哪裡來、為什麼這樣畫、爭議地區如何呈現、名稱如何選擇。'
    : 'Where the lines come from, why, how contested places are shown, and how names are chosen.'}
>
  <h2>{zh ? '免責聲明' : 'Disclaimer'}</h2>
  <blockquote class="callout">{zh ? notes?.disclaimer_zh : notes?.disclaimer_en}</blockquote>

  <h2>{zh ? '邊界從哪裡來' : 'Where the boundaries come from'}</h2>
  <p>
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          <strong>Natural Earth,1:5,000 萬比例尺</strong>（經 <code>world-atlas</code>{' '}
          套件）。Natural Earth
          為公有領域，是小比例尺主題式世界地圖的事實標準。幾何經過簡化（Visvalingam 演算法、保留 20%
          頂點、移除 5 km² 以下島嶼）至約 165
          KB，以利快速載入；它是顯示用圖層，不是法律文件。統計數字一律以 ISO 3166-1 alpha-3
          代碼連結多邊形，絕不以名稱連結。
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          <strong>Natural Earth, 1:50 million scale</strong> (via the <code>world-atlas</code>{' '}
          package). Natural Earth is public domain and is the de-facto standard for small-scale
          thematic world maps. The geometry is simplified (Visvalingam, 20 % of vertices kept,
          islands under 5 km² dropped) to about 165 KB so the map loads fast; it is a display layer,
          not a legal instrument. Statistics are joined to polygons on ISO 3166-1 alpha-3 codes,
          never on names.
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>
  <h3>{zh ? '曾評估的替代方案' : 'Alternatives considered'}</h3>
  <table class="small">
    <thead><tr><th>{zh ? '選項' : 'Option'}</th><th>{zh ? '決定' : 'Decision'}</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr
        ><td>OCHA/HDX "COD-AB global"</td><td
          >{
            zh
              ? '不採用：僅含行政層級 1–4（沒有國家外框），只涵蓋 111 國，且為 1 GB 的 geodatabase。'
              : 'Rejected: it contains administrative levels 1–4 only (no country outlines), covers 111 countries, and is a 1 GB geodatabase.'
          }</td
        ></tr
      >
      <tr
        ><td>UN Geospatial "UNmap" feature service</td><td
          >{
            zh
              ? '未來「邊界圖組切換」的候選。授權僅限聯合國秘書處；資料凍結於 2019 年；依其規則將台灣與中國同色。'
              : 'Candidate for a future "boundary set" switch. Licence restricted to the UN Secretariat; data frozen in 2019; colours Taiwan with China by rule.'
          }</td
        ></tr
      >
      <tr
        ><td>FieldMaps / USGS international boundaries (UN Clear Map style)</td><td
          >{
            zh
              ? '未來切換的候選（公有領域），需先完成 357 MB 的 GIS 轉檔。'
              : 'Candidate for a future switch (public domain), requires a 357 MB GIS conversion.'
          }</td
        ></tr
      >
      <tr
        ><td>UN Clear Map raster tiles</td><td
          >{
            zh
              ? '之後可能的替代底圖（免費、支援 CORS）。'
              : 'Possible alternative basemap later (free, CORS-enabled).'
          }</td
        ></tr
      >
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>{zh ? '名稱如何選擇' : 'How names are chosen'}</h2>
  <p>
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          名稱跟隨<strong>被引用的資料來源</strong>——即 UNHCR
          的國家清單——如此從本站產生的引用才能與上游紀錄對得上。另有小型覆寫表以利閱讀（如「Syrian
          Arab Rep.」顯示為「敘利亞」；「Serbia and Kosovo: S/RES/1244
          (1999)」顯示為「塞爾維亞」）；凡有覆寫之處，原始名稱一律並列顯示（「UNHCR
          使用之名稱：…」）。每個下載檔的 <code>name</code> 欄位永遠保留 UNHCR 原名。
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          Names follow <strong>the data source being cited</strong> — UNHCR's country list — so that
          a citation from this site matches the upstream record. A short override table improves
          readability (e.g. "Syrian Arab Rep." is shown as "Syria"; "Serbia and Kosovo: S/RES/1244
          (1999)" is shown as "Serbia"); wherever an override applies, the original name is
          displayed next to it ("Name as used by UNHCR: …"). The UNHCR name is always kept in the{' '}
          <code>name</code> field of every download.
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>

  <h2>{zh ? '爭議地區逐一說明' : 'Contested places, one by one'}</h2>
  <p>
    {
      zh
        ? '以下逐一說明每個地區如何繪製、附有哪些統計（若有）、以及各資料來源如何稱呼它。來源命名一律照錄原文、不予翻譯——改寫會使引用與上游對不上。'
        : 'For each area below we state how it is drawn, what statistics (if any) attach to it, and how each source names it. Source names are quoted verbatim, untranslated — rewriting them would break the match with the upstream record.'
    }
  </p>
  {
    notes?.notes.map((n) => (
      <section class="card" id={n.id}>
        <h3>
          {zh ? n.name_zh : n.name}
          {n.iso3 ? <code class="muted"> {n.iso3}</code> : null}
        </h3>
        <p>
          <strong>{zh ? '如何呈現：' : 'How it is shown:'}</strong>{' '}
          {zh ? n.how_shown_zh : n.how_shown}
        </p>
        <p class="small muted">
          <strong>{zh ? '來源命名：' : 'Source naming:'}</strong>{' '}
          {zh ? n.source_naming_zh : n.source_naming}
        </p>
      </section>
    ))
  }

  <h2>{zh ? '「無資料」代表什麼' : 'What "no data" means'}</h2>
  <p>
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          地圖上的灰色代表該年份、該指標<em>未報告</em>
          ——不是零，也不是「沒有流離失所者」。部分繪出的領土根本不是 UNHCR
          的統計對象（台灣、科索沃、格陵蘭與若干屬地）：它們會顯示「UNHCR
          未單獨統計」的提示。反之，少數 UNHCR
          統計對象在此沒有多邊形（馬提尼克、直布羅陀、吐瓦魯，以及「無國籍」「來源不明」兩個虛擬條目）：它們列於圖例的「無法顯示於地圖」清單，並計入每一項總計、表格與下載。驗證步驟每天保證
          <em>可上色總和 + 無法顯示總和 = 全球總計</em>。
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          Grey on the map means <em>not reported</em> for that year and metric — not zero, and not
          "no displaced people". Some drawn territories are not UNHCR reporting entities at all
          (Taiwan, Kosovo, Greenland, several dependencies): they show a tooltip "Not separately
          reported by UNHCR". Conversely, a few UNHCR entities have no polygon here (Martinique,
          Gibraltar, Tuvalu, the pseudo-entities "Stateless" and "Unknown"): they are listed in the
          legend's "cannot be shown on the map" chip and included in every total, table and
          download. The validation step guarantees{' '}
          <em>mapped total + unmappable total = global total</em> every day.
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>

  <h2>{zh ? '回報邊界或名稱問題' : 'Report an issue with a boundary or name'}</h2>
  <p>
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          請寄信至{' '}
          <a
            href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}?subject=${encodeURIComponent('[Where They Went] Boundary / name issue')}`}
          >
            {CONTACT_EMAIL}
          </a>
          ，說明地區、您看到的內容，以及（若相關）您認為應採用的來源命名。所有變更皆記錄於版本庫歷史。
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          Write to{' '}
          <a
            href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}?subject=${encodeURIComponent('[Where They Went] Boundary / name issue')}`}
          >
            {CONTACT_EMAIL}
          </a>{' '}
          with the area, what you see, and (if relevant) the source naming you think should apply.
          Changes are recorded in the repository history.
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>
  <p class="small">
    <a href={localizePath('/methodology', locale)}>{tr('nav.methodology')}</a> · <a
      href={localizePath('/about', locale)}>{tr('nav.about')}</a
    >
  </p>
</DocPage>
